245421","violation_type_title":"Mark Cleaning Supplies, Toxic Materials; Keep Separate from Food and Inaccessible to Children (26 TAC §746.3407(12))","topic_label":"Safety hazards"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1112026-i20240509-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-4801","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1112026-i20240509","date":"2024-05-09","original_code":"746.4801","severity":"medium_low","severity_label":"Medium-low risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-05-24","finding":"Definition- What does Licensing mean by the term ?use zone??: A picnic table was observed directly in front of the slide within the 6 foot use zone.","topic":"other","source_record_id":"1026485993","violation_type_title":"Definition- What does Licensing mean by the term ?use zone?? (26 TAC §746.4801)","topic_label":"Other"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1112026-i20240509-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-4503-c","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1112026-i20240509","date":"2024-05-09","original_code":"746.4503(c)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-05-24","finding":"Napping Floor Mats Marked with Sleeping Side Distinguished: The nap mats did not indicate which side the children were to sleep on and which side would face the floor.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026406194","violation_type_title":"Napping Floor Mats Marked with Sleeping Side Distinguished (26 TAC §746.4503(c))","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1112026-i20240509-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-745-641","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1112026-i20240509","date":"2024-05-09","original_code":"745.641","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-05-24","finding":"AP Background check results - Must receive notification prior to allowing subject to be present at your operation: A person was observed in the infant room being the sole caregiver of 4 infants without having a background chec